              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Cleaning (Python): fixed 3 shifted rows, filled missing director / cast / country as \"Unknown\", parsed dates, split duration into minutes and seasons, grouped 14 ratings into 4 audiences.",
